  "releaseNotes": "0.7.0 adds semantic OSC 52 clipboard and selection operations: typed clipboard/primary/secondary/select targets, bounded binary and strict UTF-8 writes, explicit byte-returning reads with caller-supplied timeout, single-reader correlated response routing, bounded late-response ownership, canonical base64/framing validation, and cross-platform security/integration acceptance.",
